          <description>All shooting attacks made by a Screaming Skull Catapult have the Flaming Attacks and Magical Attacks special rule. Any unit that suffers one or more casualties from this weapon must take a Panic
test. If the unit suffered Heavy Casualties, it takes the test at -1 Leadership.</description>
