                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="de63-d6da-efa8-00ac">The Blade of Setep gives the wielder the Ignores Armour Saves special rule. If the enemy model wears magical armour, the first Hit against this model is ignored, but the magical armour is destroyed for the remainder of the battle.</characteristic>
